      "receiptSource": "Original Receipt from \u0027\u003Ci\u003EThe Northamptonshire Federation of Women\u2019s Institutes Recipe Book\u003C/i\u003E\u0027, 1933, supplied by \u003Ca href=\u0022http://northamptonmuseums.wordpress.com/\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Enorthamptonmuseums.wordpress.com\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EA Good Northamptonshire Pudding:\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\n2ozs. butter, 4ozs. of flour, 3 ozs of castor sugar, and 2 eggs and 1 tablespoon of raspberry jam.\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nCream the butter and sugar, let it stand for 15 minutes, then add the flour eggs alternately and lastly mix in the jam. Steam for 2 hours.\u003Cbr\u003E"
